    {
      "id": "OVduSj-wCfWO8bbux4lLq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 357,
      "y": 2004,
      "width": 805.3395385742188,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 609125426,
      "version": 667,
      "versionNonce": 23430194,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793741631002,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Believe it or not, not everything can be done with .NET\n    - maybe you have some Java stuff in an API you need for\n      doing kafka streams, etc.\n    - \"Scale out using the process model\"\n        - Scale the work across other APIs\n    - Reliability - some things just crash more\n        - make that smaller, easier to work with and use caching, etc.\n    - Temporal Coupling - releases\n        - Testing drags to a halt.\n        - You are working on a \"hot edge\" - new features\n        - You have to run EVERY test every time\n    - Migration - \"Monoliths to Microservices\", upgrading from .NET Framework, etc.\n- Late Binding",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Believe it or not, not everything can be done with .NET\n    - maybe you have some Java stuff in an API you need for\n      doing kafka streams, etc.\n    - \"Scale out using the process model\"\n        - Scale the work across other APIs\n    - Reliability - some things just crash more\n        - make that smaller, easier to work with and use caching, etc.\n    - Temporal Coupling - releases\n        - Testing drags to a halt.\n        - You are working on a \"hot edge\" - new features\n        - You have to run EVERY test every time\n    - Migration - \"Monoliths to Microservices\", upgrading from .NET Framework, etc.\n- Late Binding",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
